Steps :
> mkdir manggo-api
> cd manggo-api/

> npm init
	- description: APIs for MangGo App
	- entry point: (index.js) app.js
	- author: Adit
	- the rests yes

> git init
> copy .gitignore from other api project


> npm install --save express

Cors handler (express middleware) :
- npm install --save cors

For Logger, use Pino (instead of morgan) :
- npm install --save pino pino-http
- npm install --save-dev pino-pretty

For input validations :
- npm install --save express-validator
	detail docs of validation: https://github.com/validatorjs/validator.js/blob/master/README.md

Install Prisma :
	- npm install prisma@6 --save-dev
	- npm install --save @prisma/client@6


